Array Design
we need to separate pointer as front of queue
                           and back of queue

Note: when we are using array
      some times we need to shift the core array
      but it is O(n) cost!
      so the isFull() and and enqueue() methods
      that use shift() method are O(n)
      but Queue should be O(1) in all functions!
      for solve this we use "CycleArray"


CYCLE ARRAY
instead of shifting array, that is O(n)
we can link the end of array to begging of the array!
for this we should use "Residual" (%)
we just need to check the number of item is ok (numberOfItems)!
to prevent OVERLAP!

